  Effect: Constrains vocabulary to highest-probability tokens even at higher temperature.
  Output Content:
    For ACME Corp onboarding, credential issuance strictly requires two separate team members to agree. First, Operator 1 creates the initial token in the IAM portal, and then Operator 2 (the Senior Desk Lead) verifies the authorization before granting access.
