--- TASK 4: RECOMMENDED PRODUCTION SETTINGS FOR FACTUAL ENTERPRISE RAG ---
Parameter           Recommended Setting     Engineering Rationale
---------------------------------------------------------------------------
temperature         0.0                     Eliminates sampling variance; guarantees deterministic,
                                            repeatable runbook citations across support engineer shifts.
top_p               1.0 (or omitted)        When temperature is 0.0, top_p is effectively ignored.
                                            Do not tune both temperature and top_p simultaneously.
max_tokens          150 - 250               Hard safety ceiling preventing runaway costs while allowing
                                            complete 3-5 step procedural runbook answers.
stop                ['USER:', 'NOTE:']      Optional boundary markers preventing the model from
                                            simulating subsequent conversation turns.
